/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 71 0 R
/E (Develop a console-based Java application \(PS No. 36: Hospital Patient Record System\) to maintain hospital patient records by supporting patient registration, displaying all records, searching by name, and sorting by age in ascending order. Patient data must be saved to and loaded from patients.txt, with patient IDs starting at PT101, case- insensitive name matching, and custom-written search and sort logic rather than built-in sort/search utilities. Registration must validate that name and disease are non-empty and that age lies inclusively between 0 and 120, while loading data when the application starts and saving changes on exit \(as well as after updates\). )
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [3]
>>
